      "at": "payload/.joycraft/references/testing-page.md:11",
      "summary": "Max's sota-knowledge-home note wants tests to be a useful tool, not an obligation. The benefit line (fewer slow and flaky reruns) sits only in the template preamble; the page the project gets says only \"keep its tests fast and honest\". Carry the benefit into the written page so the project's own agents read why.",
      "assumption": "The spec asks the reference to add the benefit, which it does."
